<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Redesigning Our Planet — 7 Years 7 Worlds · World 03</title>
<meta name="description" content="We have crossed a planetary threshold before. We are doing it again, on purpose this time. A scroll-led journey from the last glacial maximum to eight climate interventions built in India.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#04101B">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 viewBox=%270 0 32 32%27%3E%3Crect width=%2732%27 height=%2732%27 fill=%27%2304101B%27/%3E%3Cpath d=%27M4 24 L16 7 L28 24 Z%27 fill=%27%23B9D4E8%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wdth,wght@75..125,400..800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400..700&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,200..600;1,6..72,200..500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ============================================================
   REDESIGNING OUR PLANET — World 03, The Ice Age
   Single-file build. Palette, type scale, scenes, components.
   ============================================================ */

:root{
  /* ice */
  --void:#04101B;
  --deep:#0A2138;
  --mid:#17466B;
  --blue:#5E93BE;
  --pale:#B9D4E8;
  --frost:#E8F1F7;
  --paper:#F5F7F8;
  --ink:#0B1620;
  --ink-soft:#40525F;
  --ember:#FF8A3D;
  --ember-soft:#FFD1A3;

  /* text ramps — solid values, never opacity, so contrast is predictable */
  --tx-d1:#EDF4F9; --tx-d2:#C6D7E4; --tx-d3:#A3B8C9;
  --tx-l1:#0B1620; --tx-l2:#3B5263; --tx-l3:#54697A;
  /* a tight, dense halo beats one wide blur for type over imagery */
  --halo:0 1px 2px rgba(4,16,27,.92), 0 0 6px rgba(4,16,27,.78), 0 0 20px rgba(4,16,27,.55);

  /* tags */
  --t-heat:#FF6B3D;
  --t-water:#3D9BE0;
  --t-shade:#8C7BEA;
  --t-sun:#E8B33D;
  --t-forest:#45A86B;
  --t-agreement:#98A6B2;

  --gut: clamp(20px, 5vw, 96px);
  --measure: 62ch;

  --d: 'Archivo', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
  --m: 'Space Grotesk', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
  --b: 'Newsreader', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;

  --ease: cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);
  --ease-io: cubic-bezier(.65,.05,.36,1);
}

*,*::before,*::after{ box-sizing:border-box; }
html{ scroll-behavior:auto; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; }
body{
  margin:0; background:var(--void); color:var(--frost);
  font-family:var(--b); font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(16px,1.02vw + 12px,20px); line-height:1.62;
  overflow-x:hidden; overscroll-behavior-y:none;
  text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
}
img{ max-width:100%; display:block; }
::selection{ background:var(--ember); color:#160800; }

/* ---------- environment layers ---------- */
#env{ position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:0; pointer-events:none; }
#env canvas{ position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; }
#gl{ z-index:1; }
#fauna{ z-index:2; }
#snow{ z-index:3; }
.vig{ position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:4; pointer-events:none;
  background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 46%, transparent 38%, rgba(2,8,14,.30) 78%, rgba(2,8,14,.62) 100%);
  transition:opacity .8s var(--ease); }
.grain{ position:fixed; inset:-50%; z-index:6; pointer-events:none; opacity:.045;
  background-image:var(--grain); background-size:180px 180px;
  animation:grainShift 6s steps(6) infinite; mix-blend-mode:overlay; }
@keyframes grainShift{
  0%{transform:translate(0,0)} 20%{transform:translate(-3%,2%)} 40%{transform:translate(2%,-3%)}
  60%{transform:translate(-2%,-2%)} 80%{transform:translate(3%,1%)} 100%{transform:translate(0,0)}
}

/* ---------- loader ---------- */
#loader{ position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:200; background:var(--void);
  display:grid; place-items:center; transition:opacity 1.1s var(--ease), visibility 1.1s; }
#loader.done{ opacity:0; visibility:hidden; }
.load-in{ width:min(420px,72vw); text-align:center; }
.load-lab{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.26em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tx-d3); margin:0 0 18px; }
.load-bar{ height:1px; background:rgba(185,212,232,.18); overflow:hidden; }
.load-bar i{ display:block; height:100%; width:0%; background:var(--pale); transition:width .3s linear; }
.load-num{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.2em; color:var(--tx-d3); margin-top:12px; }

/* ---------- skip + hud ---------- */
.skip{ position:fixed; top:-100px; left:16px; z-index:300; background:var(--frost); color:var(--ink);
  padding:12px 18px; font-family:var(--m); font-size:13px; border-radius:2px; transition:top .2s; }
.skip:focus{ top:16px; }

#hud{ position:fixed; z-index:60; inset:0; pointer-events:none; }
.hud-top{ position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; padding:22px var(--gut);
  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:16px;
  color:var(--frost); transition:color .4s var(--ease); }
#hud.lit-mode .hud-top{ color:var(--ink); }
#hud.lit-mode .brand span{ color:var(--tx-l2); }
.brand{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.22em; text-transform:uppercase;
  line-height:1.7; transition:opacity .5s var(--ease); text-shadow:var(--halo); }
#hud.lit-mode .brand{ text-shadow:none; }
#hud.past-open .brand{ opacity:0; pointer-events:none; }
.brand b{ font-weight:700; display:block; }
.brand span{ color:var(--tx-d3); }
.hud-right{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; pointer-events:auto; }
.snd{ appearance:none; background:rgba(6,18,30,.52); backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  border:1px solid currentColor; color:inherit;
  font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:8px 12px; border-radius:100px; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  transition:background .3s, border-color .3s; }
.snd:hover,.snd:focus-visible{ background:rgba(255,255,255,.16); }
#hud.lit-mode .snd{ background:rgba(255,255,255,.6); }
#hud.lit-mode .snd:hover,#hud.lit-mode .snd:focus-visible{ background:rgba(11,22,32,.10); }
.snd i{ width:16px; height:9px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:2px; }
.snd i s{ flex:1; height:2px; background:currentColor; text-decoration:none; transform-origin:center; transition:height .2s; }
.snd.on i s{ animation:eq .9s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
.snd.on i s:nth-child(2){ animation-delay:.15s } .snd.on i s:nth-child(3){ animation-delay:.3s }
.snd.on i s:nth-child(4){ animation-delay:.45s }
@keyframes eq{ from{height:2px} to{height:9px} }

/* chapter rail */
.rail{ position:absolute; right:calc(var(--gut) * .55); top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%);
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; pointer-events:auto; opacity:0;
  color:var(--frost); transition:opacity .6s var(--ease), color .4s var(--ease); }
#hud.lit-mode .rail{ color:var(--ink); }
.rail.show{ opacity:1; }
.rail a{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:flex-end; gap:10px;
  text-decoration:none; color:inherit; padding:5px 0; }
.rail .dash{ display:block; width:16px; height:1px; background:currentColor; opacity:.34;
  transition:width .45s var(--ease), opacity .45s; }
.rail .lbl{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase;
  opacity:0; transform:translateX(6px); transition:opacity .35s, transform .35s var(--ease); white-space:nowrap; }
.rail a:hover .lbl,.rail a:focus-visible .lbl{ opacity:.75; transform:none; }
.rail a[aria-current="true"] .dash{ width:32px; opacity:1; }
.rail{ right:calc(var(--gut) * .34); }

.cue{ position:absolute; left:var(--gut); bottom:34px;
  font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.26em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tx-d1); text-shadow:var(--halo);
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px;
  transition:opacity .6s var(--ease); }
.cue::after{ content:''; width:1px; height:34px; background:linear-gradient(rgba(232,241,247,.7),transparent);
  animation:cueDrop 2.1s var(--ease-io) infinite; }
@keyframes cueDrop{ 0%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:top} 45%{transform:scaleY(1);transform-origin:top}
  46%{transform-origin:bottom} 100%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:bottom} }

/* ---------- generic scene scaffolding ---------- */
main{ position:relative; z-index:10; }
.act{ position:relative; }
.stage{ position:sticky; top:0; height:100svh; display:grid; place-items:center;
  padding:0 var(--gut); }
.wrap{ width:min(1360px,100%); margin-inline:auto; }

/* Every label on the site is Space Grotesk. Without an explicit weight they all
   inherited body's 300 — a weight the family never loads — so each one rendered
   a step lighter than intended. Floors raised to 11px, tracking pulled back. */
.eyebrow,.brand,.cue,.rail .lbl,.load-lab,.load-num,.beat .n,.plate figcaption,
.lab-hd,.lab-ft,.lab-btn,.toggles button,.mech button,.outcome p,.xf-labels,
.iv-meta dl,.stats span,.map-src,.mp-idx,.mp-loc,.chip,.map-list button,
.q h3,.opts button,.dp-out p,.f-note,.f-src,.f-src h4,.f-end,.ec-lab,.ec-note,
.snd,.mk .lbl,.grat .gl,.toggles .st{ font-weight:500; }

.eyebrow{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:clamp(11px,.66vw,12px); letter-spacing:.24em;
  text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--tx-d3); margin:0 0 clamp(14px,1.6vw,26px);
  font-weight:600; }
.eyebrow.on-light{ color:var(--tx-l2); }

h1,h2,h3,h4{ font-family:var(--d); font-weight:700; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 112;
  letter-spacing:-.026em; line-height:.92; margin:0; text-wrap:balance; }
.h-hero{ font-size:clamp(31px,5.4vw,88px); font-variation-settings:'wdth' 106; font-weight:700; max-width:12ch;
  line-height:.95; text-shadow:0 2px 30px rgba(4,16,27,.5), 0 1px 3px rgba(4,16,27,.4); }
.h-1{ font-size:clamp(34px,6.2vw,104px); }
.h-2{ font-size:clamp(28px,4.1vw,66px); }
.h-3{ font-size:clamp(21px,2.2vw,34px); font-variation-settings:'wdth' 104; letter-spacing:-.018em; line-height:1.02; }
.lede{ font-size:clamp(18px,1.4vw,25px); line-height:1.5; font-weight:300; }
p{ margin:0 0 1.05em; max-width:var(--measure); }
p:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
.dim{ color:var(--tx-d2); }
.dim-l{ color:var(--tx-l2); }

/* reveal */
[data-rv]{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(26px); transition:opacity 1s var(--ease), transform 1.15s var(--ease); }
[data-rv].in{ opacity:1; transform:none; }
[data-rv][data-rv="mask"]{ transform:none; clip-path:inset(0 0 102% 0); transition:clip-path 1.15s var(--ease), opacity .5s; }
[data-rv][data-rv="mask"].in{ clip-path:inset(0 0 -2% 0); }

/* ---------- ACT 0 hero ---------- */
.act--hero{ height:165svh; }
.act--hero .stage{ align-content:center; place-items:center start; }
.hero-in{ text-align:left; max-width:min(1180px,100%); position:relative; z-index:2; }
/* No colour choice makes light type legible on a light glacier, so the copy
   column gets its own ground. It reads as cinematic grading, not a panel. */
.hero-scrim{ position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1; pointer-events:none;
  background:linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(4,16,27,.66) 0%, rgba(4,16,27,.52) 26%,
    rgba(4,16,27,.24) 46%, rgba(4,16,27,0) 62%);
  transition:opacity .6s var(--ease); }

/* ---------- the monument ---------- */
#fauna{ position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:2; pointer-events:none; overflow:hidden; }
#mamWrap{ position:absolute; width:57vw; min-width:420px; left:49vw; bottom:-9vh;
  will-change:transform,opacity; }
#mamWrap img{ display:block; width:100%; height:auto;
  filter:contrast(1.10) brightness(.96);
  -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#000 84%,transparent 100%);
  mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#000 84%,transparent 100%); }
.hero-in .eyebrow{ color:var(--tx-d1); text-shadow:var(--halo);
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; }
.hero-in .eyebrow::after{ content:none; }
.hero-in .eyebrow::before{ content:''; width:26px; height:1px;
  background:rgba(232,241,247,.42); }
.hero-in .h-hero{ margin-bottom:clamp(16px,1.8vw,26px); }
.hero-sub{ font-size:clamp(16.5px,1.12vw,20px); color:var(--tx-d1); font-weight:400;
  max-width:38ch; font-style:italic; line-height:1.5; text-shadow:var(--halo); }
.hero-rule{ width:44px; height:1px; background:rgba(232,241,247,.45); margin:clamp(20px,2.4vw,32px) 0; }
.act--threshold .h-2,.act--threshold .h-2 em{ transition:color .55s var(--ease); }
.act--threshold.inv .h-2{ color:var(--ink); text-shadow:0 2px 30px rgba(245,247,248,.9); }
.act--threshold.inv .h-2 em{ color:#C2470E; }

/* ---------- ACT 1 beats ---------- */
.act--beats{ height:340svh; }
.beats{ position:relative; width:100%; max-width:1100px; height:100svh; }
.beat{ position:absolute; inset:0; display:grid; align-content:center;
  opacity:0; transition:opacity .55s var(--ease); }
.beat.on{ opacity:1; }
.beat .h-1{ line-height:.9; }
.beat .n{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:.22em; color:var(--tx-d1);
  margin-bottom:20px; display:inline-block; font-weight:600;
  padding:6px 12px 5px; border-radius:100px;
  background:rgba(4,16,27,.62); backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  border:1px solid rgba(237,244,249,.20); }
.beat:nth-child(1){ justify-items:start; text-align:left; }
.beat:nth-child(2){ justify-items:end; text-align:right; }
.beat:nth-child(3){ justify-items:start; text-align:left; }
.beat:nth-child(4){ justify-items:center; text-align:center; }
.beat:nth-child(4) .h-1{ color:#FFE9CF; text-shadow:0 0 46px rgba(255,138,61,.5), 0 0 120px rgba(255,138,61,.24); }
.beat:nth-child(4) .n{ color:var(--ember-soft); }

/* ---------- ACT 2 body ---------- */
.act--body{ height:145svh; }
.body-in{ max-width:min(760px,100%); }
.body-in p{ font-size:clamp(19px,1.62vw,30px); line-height:1.48; max-width:none; font-weight:300; }
.body-in .drop::first-letter{ font-family:var(--d); font-weight:700; font-size:3.1em; line-height:.78;
  float:left; padding:.06em .12em .02em 0; color:var(--pale); }

/* ---------- ACT 3 what we made ---------- */
.act--made{ height:250svh; }
.made-grid{ display:grid; gap:clamp(18px,2.4vw,44px); width:100%; max-width:1300px;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); align-items:center; }
.made-head{ grid-column:1 / span 12; text-align:center; margin-bottom:clamp(10px,2vw,26px); }
.made-head .h-1{ font-variation-settings:'wdth' 122; }
.plate{ position:relative; will-change:transform; }
.made-head{ will-change:transform; }
.plate canvas{ display:block; width:100%; height:auto; }
.plate figcaption{ position:relative; font-family:var(--m); font-size:clamp(11.5px,.8vw,13px);
  line-height:1.55; letter-spacing:.01em; color:var(--tx-d1); margin-top:14px; padding-right:6%;
  text-shadow:var(--halo); }
/* the ice behind the captions swings from near-black to bright vein, so each
   caption carries its own soft ground rather than fighting the background */
.plate figcaption::before{ content:''; position:absolute; z-index:-1;
  inset:2px 20% 2px -2px; background:rgba(4,16,27,.62);
  border-radius:50px; filter:blur(26px); }
.made-head .h-1{ text-shadow:0 2px 46px rgba(4,16,27,.5); }
.plate:nth-of-type(1){ grid-column:1 / span 4; }
.plate:nth-of-type(2){ grid-column:5 / span 4; margin-top:-4%; }
.plate:nth-of-type(3){ grid-column:9 / span 4; margin-top:5%; }

/* ---------- ACT 4 threshold ---------- */
.act--threshold{ height:165svh; }
.threshold{ max-width:min(1000px,100%); text-align:center; }
.threshold .h-2{ font-variation-settings:'wdth' 100; font-weight:600; line-height:1.06;
  text-shadow:0 2px 40px rgba(4,16,27,.65); }
.threshold .h-2 em{ font-style:normal; color:var(--ember-soft); }

/* ---------- ACT 5 whiteout ---------- */
.act--white{ height:180svh;
  background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(245,247,248,0) 0%, rgba(245,247,248,0) 34%,
    rgba(245,247,248,.55) 58%, var(--paper) 76%); }
.white-in{ text-align:center; }

/* ---------- light chapters ---------- */
.lit{ background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); position:relative; z-index:11; }
.lit p{ color:var(--ink-soft); }
.lit h1,.lit h2,.lit h3{ color:var(--ink); }
.lit ::selection{ background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); }

/* PROOF */
#proof{ padding:0 var(--gut); }
.proof-pin{ position:relative; height:330svh; }
.proof-stage{ position:sticky; top:0; min-height:100svh; display:grid; align-content:center;
  padding:clamp(70px,11vh,130px) 0 clamp(50px,8vh,90px); }
.proof-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:clamp(18px,2.4vw,44px);
  width:min(1360px,100%); margin-inline:auto; align-items:start;
  row-gap:clamp(26px,4vh,58px); }
.proof-head{ grid-column:1 / span 12; padding-bottom:clamp(12px,1.8vw,26px);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,22,32,.14); }
.proof-head .h-1{ font-variation-settings:'wdth' 120; font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,80px); }

.earth-hold{ grid-column:1 / span 5; margin:0; display:grid; justify-items:center;
  align-content:start; }
.earth-wrap{ position:relative; display:grid; place-items:center; }
.earth-wrap canvas{ width:clamp(180px,23vw,330px); height:auto; display:block;
  will-change:transform; }
.earth-year{ position:absolute; left:50%; bottom:-6%; transform:translateX(-50%);
  font-family:var(--d); font-weight:700; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 84;
  font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,58px); letter-spacing:-.03em; color:var(--ink);
  margin:0; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; line-height:1;
  text-shadow:0 2px 22px var(--paper), 0 0 10px var(--paper); }
.earth-cap{ margin-top:clamp(26px,3vw,44px); text-align:center; display:grid; gap:6px; }
.ec-lab{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tx-l3); }
.ec-note{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.02em; color:var(--tx-l1);
  min-height:1.5em; transition:opacity .4s var(--ease); }

.proof-body{ grid-column:7 / span 6; }
.proof-body > p:first-child{ font-size:clamp(15px,1.05vw,18px); line-height:1.6; }
.stats{ list-style:none; padding:0; margin:clamp(22px,3vw,40px) 0 0; display:grid; gap:0;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(11,22,32,.14); }
.stats li{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(150px,34%) 1fr; gap:clamp(12px,1.8vw,28px);
  padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,22,32,.14); align-items:baseline; }
.stats b{ font-family:var(--d); font-weight:700; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 108;
  font-size:clamp(19px,1.9vw,30px); letter-spacing:-.02em; color:var(--ink); line-height:1;
  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
.stats span{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:clamp(11.5px,.8vw,13px); line-height:1.55; color:var(--tx-l2); }
.pull{ font-family:var(--d); font-weight:600; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 106;
  font-size:clamp(19px,2.3vw,34px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:-.022em; color:var(--ink);
  max-width:22ch; margin:clamp(24px,3.4vw,50px) 0 0; }

[data-pb]{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(20px);
  transition:opacity .7s var(--ease), transform .8s var(--ease); }
[data-pb].pb-in{ opacity:1; transform:none; }

.proof-after{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:clamp(20px,3vw,56px);
  width:min(1360px,100%); margin:0 auto; padding:clamp(50px,9vh,120px) 0 clamp(60px,10vh,130px); }
.catch{ grid-column:7 / span 6; border-left:2px solid var(--ember);
  padding-left:clamp(18px,2vw,30px); }
.catch h3{ font-size:clamp(15px,1.05vw,19px); font-variation-settings:'wdth' 100; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:.02em; margin-bottom:12px; }

/* ---------- interventions ---------- */
#interventions{ padding:clamp(50px,8vh,110px) 0 0; }
.iv-intro{ padding:0 var(--gut) clamp(40px,6vh,90px); }
.iv-intro .wrap{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:clamp(20px,3vw,56px); }
.iv-intro .h-2{ grid-column:1 / span 6; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 114; }
.iv-intro p{ grid-column:8 / span 5; align-self:end; }

.iv-deck{ padding:0 var(--gut) clamp(40px,7vh,110px); perspective:1400px; }
.iv{ position:sticky; top:clamp(46px,7vh,84px); margin:0 auto clamp(150px,24vh,280px);
  width:min(1360px,100%); min-height:min(660px,74vh);
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;
  background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid rgba(11,22,32,.11); border-radius:5px;
  box-shadow:0 30px 70px -40px rgba(11,22,32,.42), 0 2px 6px -2px rgba(11,22,32,.10);
  padding:clamp(24px,2.8vw,46px) clamp(22px,2.6vw,44px);
  transform-origin:50% 8%; will-change:transform,opacity,filter; backface-visibility:hidden; }
.iv:last-of-type{ margin-bottom:clamp(30px,6vh,80px); }
.iv .wrap{ width:100%; }
.iv .wrap{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:clamp(18px,2.4vw,44px); align-items:start; }
.iv-meta{ grid-column:1 / span 3; }
.iv-step{ position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:2px; background:rgba(11,22,32,.08);
  border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; overflow:hidden; }
.iv-step i{ display:block; height:100%; background:var(--ink); width:0; transition:width .5s var(--ease); }
.iv-num{ font-family:var(--d); font-weight:700; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 78;
  font-size:clamp(48px,5.4vw,96px); line-height:.78; letter-spacing:-.04em; color:var(--ink);
  display:block; margin-bottom:14px; }
.iv-meta dl{ margin:0; font-family:var(--m); font-size:12px; line-height:1.62; }
.iv-meta dt{ color:var(--tx-l3); letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:10.5px; margin-top:14px; }
.iv-meta dd{ margin:3px 0 0; color:var(--ink); }
.iv-body{ grid-column:4 / span 4; }
.iv-body p{ font-size:clamp(15px,1.05vw,17.5px); line-height:1.62; }
.iv-body .h-3{ margin-bottom:clamp(16px,1.6vw,26px); }
.iv-lab{ grid-column:8 / span 5; }

/* interactive lab shell */
.lab{ background:#0A1620; color:var(--frost); --lab-dim:#9FB2C0; border-radius:3px; overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 24px 60px -30px rgba(10,22,32,.5); }
.lab.light{ background:#E4EBF0; color:var(--ink); --lab-dim:#42566A; }
.lab-hd{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:12px;
  padding:12px 16px; font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase;
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
.lab.light .lab-hd{ border-color:rgba(11,22,32,.14); }
.lab-hd .k{ color:var(--lab-dim); }
.lab-hd .v{ font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.1em; }
.lab-bd{ position:relative; }
.lab-bd canvas{ display:block; width:100%; height:auto; touch-action:none; cursor:crosshair; }
.lab-ft{ padding:12px 16px; font-family:var(--m); font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:.05em;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); color:var(--lab-dim);
  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
.lab.light .lab-ft{ border-color:rgba(11,22,32,.14); }
.lab-btn{ appearance:none; background:none; border:1px solid currentColor; color:inherit; cursor:pointer;
  font-family:var(--m); font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:7px 12px; border-radius:100px; transition:background .25s, color .25s; }
.lab-btn:hover,.lab-btn:focus-visible{ opacity:1; background:rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
.lab.light .lab-btn:hover,.lab.light .lab-btn:focus-visible{ background:rgba(11,22,32,.08); }

/* 02 roof grid */
.roofs{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(10,1fr); gap:3px; padding:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,#B8A996,#8E8071); }
.roofs button{ appearance:none; border:0; aspect-ratio:1; cursor:pointer; padding:0; border-radius:1px;
  background:#6E5B49 linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(255,255,255,.16),rgba(0,0,0,.22));
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.16);
  transition:background .5s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s; }
.roofs button[aria-pressed="true"]{
  background:#F6F9FA linear-gradient(150deg,#FFFFFF,#DCE6EC);
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(11,22,32,.10), 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,.5); }
.roofs button:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--ember); outline-offset:2px; z-index:2; }

/* 03 toggles */
.toggles{ display:grid; gap:0; }
.toggles button{ appearance:none; background:none; border:0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,22,32,.14);
  text-align:left; padding:15px 16px; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between; gap:14px; font-family:var(--m); font-size:11.5px; color:inherit;
  letter-spacing:.02em; transition:background .3s; }
.toggles button:hover{ background:rgba(11,22,32,.05); }
.toggles button:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--ember); outline-offset:-2px; }
.toggles .st{ font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--lab-dim); }
.toggles button[aria-pressed="true"]{ color:#2C7A4E; }
.toggles button[aria-pressed="true"] .st{ color:#2C7A4E; }

/* 04 mechanism */
.mech{ display:grid; gap:2px; padding:14px; }
.mech button{ appearance:none; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
  color:inherit; cursor:pointer; font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.04em;
  padding:12px 14px; text-align:left; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:12px;
  transition:opacity .35s, background .35s, border-color .35s; border-radius:2px; }
.mech button[aria-pressed="false"]{ color:var(--lab-dim); border-style:dashed;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
.mech button:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--ember); outline-offset:2px; }
.mech .dot{ width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--t-forest); flex:none; }
.mech button[aria-pressed="false"] .dot{ background:var(--t-heat); }
.outcome{ padding:14px 16px 18px; }
.meter{ height:3px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.14); overflow:hidden; }
.meter i{ display:block; height:100%; width:100%; background:var(--t-forest); transition:width .6s var(--ease), background .6s; }
.outcome p{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; margin:12px 0 0;
  color:var(--lab-dim); max-width:none; }

/* 05 slider */
.xfade{ padding:16px; }
.xfade input[type=range]{ width:100%; margin:14px 0 0; accent-color:var(--ember); }
.xf-labels{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-family:var(--m); font-size:10.5px;
  letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--lab-dim); margin-top:8px; }

/* ---------- india map ---------- */
#india{ padding:clamp(70px,11vh,150px) var(--gut) clamp(70px,11vh,150px);
  border-top:1px solid rgba(11,22,32,.12); }
.map-head{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:clamp(20px,3vw,56px);
  width:min(1440px,100%); margin:0 auto clamp(34px,5vw,66px); }
.map-head .num{ grid-column:1 / span 2; }
.map-head .h-2{ grid-column:3 / span 5; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 110; }
.map-head p{ grid-column:9 / span 4; align-self:end; }

.map-shell{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:clamp(24px,3.4vw,64px);
  width:min(1440px,100%); margin-inline:auto; align-items:start; }
.map-hold{ grid-column:1 / span 7; position:relative; padding:0 4px; }
.map-hold svg{ width:100%; height:auto; display:block; overflow:visible; }
.map-src{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tx-l3); margin:18px 0 0; }

.grat line{ stroke:rgba(11,22,32,.10); stroke-width:1; stroke-dasharray:3 6; }
.grat .gl{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.12em; fill:rgba(11,22,32,.46); }
.land path,.land circle{ fill:url(#hatch); stroke:var(--ink); stroke-width:2.1;
  stroke-linejoin:round; vector-effect:non-scaling-stroke; }

.mk{ cursor:pointer; }
.mk .hit{ fill:transparent; }
.mk .lead{ stroke:rgba(11,22,32,.34); stroke-width:1.2; }
.mk .tie{ stroke:rgba(11,22,32,.30); stroke-width:1; stroke-dasharray:2 3; }
.mk .dot{ transition:r .3s var(--ease); }
.mk .ring{ fill:none; stroke-width:1.6; opacity:0; transition:opacity .35s, r .45s var(--ease); }
.mk .foc{ fill:none; stroke:var(--ink); stroke-width:1.4; stroke-dasharray:3 3; opacity:0; }
.mk .lbl-s{ display:none; }
.mk .lbl{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:16px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
  fill:var(--tx-l2); transition:fill .3s;
  paint-order:stroke fill; stroke:var(--paper); stroke-width:5px; stroke-linejoin:round; }
.mk:hover .ring,.mk[aria-current="true"] .ring{ opacity:1; }
.mk:hover .lbl,.mk[aria-current="true"] .lbl{ fill:var(--ink); }
.mk[aria-current="true"] .dot{ r:8; }
.mk:focus{ outline:none; }
.mk:focus-visible .foc{ opacity:1; }
.mk:focus-visible .ring{ opacity:1; }

.map-side{ grid-column:9 / span 4; position:sticky; top:clamp(60px,10vh,110px);
  display:grid; gap:clamp(24px,3vw,40px); }
.map-list{ list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; counter-reset:mp;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(11,22,32,.16); }
.map-list li{ counter-increment:mp; }
.map-list button{ appearance:none; width:100%; text-align:left; background:none; cursor:pointer;
  border:0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,22,32,.12);
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; column-gap:12px; row-gap:2px;
  align-items:baseline; padding:11px 4px 11px 0; transition:background .25s, padding .25s var(--ease); }
.map-list button::before{ content:counter(mp,decimal-leading-zero); grid-row:1 / span 2;
  font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.12em; color:var(--tx-l3); padding-top:3px; }
.map-list i{ display:none; }
.map-list .ml-n{ font-family:var(--d); font-weight:600; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 100;
  font-size:clamp(13px,.95vw,15px); letter-spacing:-.01em; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.15; }
.map-list .ml-m{ grid-column:2; font-family:var(--m); font-size:11.5px; color:var(--tx-l2); letter-spacing:.02em; }
.map-list button:hover{ background:rgba(11,22,32,.045); padding-left:8px; }
.map-list button:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--ember); outline-offset:-2px; }
.map-list button[aria-current="true"]{ background:var(--ink); padding-left:10px; }
.map-list button[aria-current="true"] .ml-n{ color:var(--paper); }
.map-list button[aria-current="true"] .ml-m{ color:rgba(245,247,248,.66); }
.map-list button[aria-current="true"]::before{ color:rgba(245,247,248,.55); }

.map-panel{ border-top:2px solid var(--ink); padding-top:20px; min-height:280px; }
.mp-idx{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tx-l3); margin-bottom:14px; }
.mp-name{ font-family:var(--d); font-weight:700; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 106;
  font-size:clamp(21px,2vw,32px); line-height:1.02; letter-spacing:-.022em; margin-bottom:14px; }
.mp-meta{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px 10px; margin-bottom:18px; align-items:center; }
.chip{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:5px 11px; border-radius:100px; color:#fff; font-weight:600; }
.mp-loc{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:.04em; color:var(--tx-l2); }
.mp-body{ font-size:clamp(15px,1.05vw,17.5px); line-height:1.62; }
.mp-nav{ display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:24px; }
.mp-nav button{ appearance:none; background:none; border:1px solid rgba(11,22,32,.25); color:var(--ink);
  width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer; font-size:14px; line-height:1;
  transition:background .25s, border-color .25s; }
.mp-nav button:hover,.mp-nav button:focus-visible{ background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); border-color:var(--ink); }

/* ---------- design a planet ---------- */
#planet{ background:var(--void); color:var(--frost); position:relative; z-index:11;
  padding:clamp(80px,13vh,170px) var(--gut); overflow:hidden; }
#planet::before{ content:''; position:absolute; inset:0;
  background:radial-gradient(90% 70% at 50% 110%, rgba(23,70,107,.55), transparent 70%); pointer-events:none; }
.dp{ width:min(1300px,100%); margin-inline:auto; position:relative; }
.dp-head{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:clamp(20px,3vw,56px);
  margin-bottom:clamp(40px,6vw,84px); }
.dp-head .h-2{ grid-column:1 / span 6; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 116; }
.dp-head p{ grid-column:8 / span 5; align-self:end; color:var(--tx-d1); }
.qs{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:clamp(14px,1.8vw,28px); }
.q{ border-top:1px solid rgba(185,212,232,.24); padding-top:18px; }
.q h3{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tx-d3); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px; }
.q .qq{ font-family:var(--b); font-size:clamp(15px,1.08vw,19px); line-height:1.35; margin-bottom:18px;
  color:var(--frost); font-weight:300; }
.opts{ display:grid; gap:6px; }
.opts button{ appearance:none; background:rgba(185,212,232,.06); border:1px solid rgba(185,212,232,.2);
  color:var(--frost); text-align:left; padding:12px 14px; cursor:pointer; border-radius:2px;
  font-family:var(--m); font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.45; letter-spacing:.01em;
  transition:background .3s, border-color .3s, transform .3s var(--ease); }
.opts button:hover{ background:rgba(185,212,232,.13); transform:translateX(3px); }
.opts button:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--ember); outline-offset:2px; }
.opts button[aria-pressed="true"]{ background:var(--frost); color:var(--ink); border-color:var(--frost); }
.dp-out{ margin-top:clamp(44px,6vw,84px); border-top:1px solid rgba(185,212,232,.24); padding-top:28px;
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:clamp(20px,3vw,56px); align-items:start; }
.dp-out .h-3{ grid-column:1 / span 7; font-family:var(--d); font-weight:600;
  font-size:clamp(20px,2.3vw,36px); line-height:1.12; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
.dp-out .h-3 b{ font-weight:700; color:var(--ember-soft); }
.dp-out p{ grid-column:9 / span 4; font-family:var(--m); font-size:12px; line-height:1.65;
  color:var(--tx-d2); }

/* ---------- closing ---------- */
#closing{ position:relative; z-index:11; height:190svh; }
#closing .stage{ background:transparent; align-content:end; padding-bottom:12vh; place-items:end center; }
.close-in{ text-align:center; max-width:min(880px,100%); }
.close-in .h-1{ font-variation-settings:'wdth' 118; margin-bottom:clamp(24px,3vw,44px);
  margin-top:clamp(40px,9vh,120px); }
.close-in p{ margin-inline:auto; color:var(--tx-d1); font-weight:300; }
.close-in .final{ font-family:var(--d); font-weight:600; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 104;
  font-size:clamp(19px,1.9vw,30px); line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-.016em; color:var(--frost);
  margin-top:clamp(26px,3vw,44px); }

footer{ position:relative; z-index:11; background:var(--void); color:var(--tx-d2);
  padding:clamp(50px,8vh,90px) var(--gut) clamp(34px,5vh,60px);
  border-top:1px solid rgba(185,212,232,.16); }
footer .wrap{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:clamp(20px,3vw,56px); }
.f-brand{ grid-column:1 / span 4; }
.f-brand b{ font-family:var(--d); font-weight:700; font-variation-settings:'wdth' 108;
  font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,23px); color:var(--frost); display:block; letter-spacing:-.018em; margin-bottom:10px; }
.f-note{ grid-column:6 / span 3; font-family:var(--m); font-size:12px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--tx-d2); }
.f-src{ grid-column:9 / span 4; }
.f-src h4{ font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tx-d3); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:12px; }
.f-src ol{ margin:0; padding:0; list-style:none; counter-reset:s;
  font-family:var(--m); font-size:11.5px; line-height:1.7; }
.f-src li{ counter-increment:s; padding-left:24px; position:relative; margin-bottom:7px; }
.f-src li::before{ content:counter(s,decimal-leading-zero); position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--tx-d3); }
.f-src a{ color:var(--tx-d1); text-decoration:none; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(232,241,247,.28);
  transition:color .25s, border-color .25s; }
.f-src a:hover,.f-src a:focus-visible{ color:var(--frost); border-color:var(--frost); }
.f-end{ grid-column:1 / span 12; margin-top:clamp(34px,5vw,64px); padding-top:20px;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(185,212,232,.14);
  font-family:var(--m); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--tx-d3); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; }

/* ---------- responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width:1000px){
  .proof-grid > *,.proof-after > *{ grid-column:1 / -1 !important; }
  .proof-pin{ height:auto; }
  .proof-stage{ position:static; min-height:0; padding:clamp(50px,9vh,90px) 0 0; }
  .earth-hold{ margin-bottom:clamp(26px,5vh,46px); }
  [data-pb]{ opacity:1; transform:none; }
  .proof-after{ padding-top:clamp(34px,6vh,60px); }
  .iv .wrap > *{ grid-column:1 / -1 !important; }
  .iv-deck{ perspective:none; }
  .iv{ position:static; margin-bottom:clamp(26px,5vh,44px); transform:none !important;
    opacity:1 !important; filter:none !important; min-height:0; display:block; }
  .iv-meta{ position:static; display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; gap:0 22px; align-items:center; }
  .iv-num{ font-size:clamp(48px,13vw,80px); margin:0; }
  .iv-meta dl{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:0 18px; }
  .iv-body{ margin-top:22px; }
  .iv-lab{ margin-top:30px; }
  .iv-intro .wrap > *{ grid-column:1 / -1 !important; }
  .iv-intro p{ margin-top:20px; }
  .map-head > *,.map-shell > *{ grid-column:1 / -1 !important; }
  .map-head .num{ margin-bottom:10px; }
  .map-head p{ margin-top:18px; }
  .map-side{ position:static; margin-top:36px; }
  .map-panel{ min-height:0; }
  .map-hold{ max-width:640px; margin-inline:auto; }
  .mk .lbl{ display:none; }
  .mk .lbl-s{ display:block; font-size:30px; stroke-width:9px; }
  .mk .lead{ stroke-width:2; }
  .mk .dot{ r:10; }
  .mk[aria-current="true"] .dot{ r:13; }
  .mk .ring{ r:21; stroke-width:2.6; }
  .grat .gl{ font-size:22px; }
  .land path,.land circle{ stroke-width:1.6; }
  .qs{ grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
  .dp-head > *,.dp-out > *{ grid-column:1 / -1 !important; }
  .dp-head p{ margin-top:18px; }
  .dp-out p{ margin-top:18px; }
  footer .wrap > *{ grid-column:1 / -1 !important; }
  .f-note,.f-src{ margin-top:30px; }
  /* the plate chapter scrolls naturally on small screens instead of being pinned */
  .act--made{ height:auto; }
  .act--made .stage{ position:static; height:auto; padding:14vh var(--gut) 16vh; }
  .made-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:clamp(34px,8vw,60px); }
  .made-head{ grid-column:1 / -1; margin-bottom:clamp(12px,4vw,30px); }
  .plate:nth-of-type(1),.plate:nth-of-type(2),.plate:nth-of-type(3){
    grid-column:1 / -1; transform:none; width:min(74%,340px); }
  .plate:nth-of-type(2){ margin-left:auto; }
  .plate:nth-of-type(3){ margin-left:13%; }
  .plate figcaption{ padding-right:0; }
  .rail{ display:none; }
}
@media (max-width:640px){
  .qs{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .roofs{ grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr); }
  .act--hero{ height:150svh; }
  .act--hero .stage{ align-content:start; padding-top:clamp(96px,15vh,150px); }
  #mamWrap{ width:112vw; min-width:0; left:2vw; bottom:-2vh; }
  .act--hero .hero-in{ position:relative; z-index:2; }
  .h-hero{ text-shadow:0 2px 30px rgba(6,22,38,.72), 0 1px 3px rgba(6,22,38,.5); }
  .h-hero{ max-width:none; }
  .hero-sub{ max-width:30ch; }
  .act--beats{ height:320svh; }
  .made-head .h-1{ font-size:clamp(24px,6.6vw,38px); }
  .h-1{ font-size:clamp(28px,8.4vw,52px); }
  .h-hero{ font-size:clamp(28px,8.2vw,48px); }
  .beat:nth-child(1),.beat:nth-child(2),.beat:nth-child(3),.beat:nth-child(4){
    justify-items:center; text-align:center; }
  .stats li{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:6px; }
  .hud-top{ padding:16px var(--gut); }
  .brand span{ display:none; }
  .iv-meta{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .iv-meta dl{ grid-template-columns:1fr; margin-top:10px; }
  .iv-meta dt{ margin-top:12px; }
  .mp-nav button{ width:46px; height:46px; }
  .toggles button{ padding:17px 16px; }
}

/* ---------- reduced motion ---------- */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{ animation-duration:.001ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important;
    transition-duration:.001ms !important; }
  .grain{ display:none; }
  [data-rv]{ opacity:1 !important; transform:none !important; clip-path:none !important; }
  .cue::after{ animation:none; }
}
html.rm .beat{ position:relative; inset:auto; opacity:1; margin-bottom:14vh; }
html.rm .beats{ height:auto; display:grid; align-content:center; }
html.rm .act--beats{ height:auto; }
html.rm .act--beats .stage{ position:static; height:auto; padding-block:16vh; }
html.rm .act--hero,html.rm .act--body,html.rm .act--made,
html.rm .act--threshold,html.rm .act--white,html.rm #closing{ height:auto; }
html.rm .stage{ position:static; height:auto; min-height:auto; padding-block:16vh; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#proof">Skip the opening sequence</a>

<div id="loader" role="status" aria-live="polite">
  <div class="load-in">
    <p class="load-lab">7 Years 7 Worlds · World 03</p>
    <div class="load-bar"><i></i></div>
    <p class="load-num"><span id="loadNum">0</span>%</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="env" aria-hidden="true">
  <canvas id="gl"></canvas>
  <div id="fauna"><div id="mamWrap"><img id="mamImg" alt=""></div></div>
  <canvas id="snow"></canvas>
  <div class="vig" id="vig"></div>
</div>
<div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div id="hud">
  <div class="hud-top">
    <p class="brand"><b>Redesigning our planet</b><span>World 03 — The Ice Age</span></p>
    <div class="hud-right">
      <button class="snd" id="snd" aria-pressed="false">
        <i aria-hidden="true"><s></s><s></s><s></s><s></s></i>
        <span id="sndLbl">Sound off</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="rail" id="rail" aria-label="Chapters">
    <a href="#top"><span class="lbl">Opening</span><span class="dash"></span></a>
    <a href="#proof"><span class="lbl">Proof</span><span class="dash"></span></a>
    <a href="#interventions"><span class="lbl">Interventions</span><span class="dash"></span></a>
    <a href="#india"><span class="lbl">India</span><span class="dash"></span></a>
    <a href="#planet"><span class="lbl">Design a planet</span><span class="dash"></span></a>
    <a href="#closing"><span class="lbl">Close</span><span class="dash"></span></a>
  </nav>
  <p class="cue" id="cue">Scroll</p>
</div>

<main id="top">

  <!-- ============ ACT 0 · HERO ============ -->
  <section class="act act--hero" aria-label="Opening">
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="wrap hero-in">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-rv>7 Years 7 Worlds · World 03</p>
        <h1 class="h-hero" data-rv="mask">Redesigning our&nbsp;planet — bit by bit, step by&nbsp;step</h1>
        <div class="hero-rule" data-rv></div>
        <p class="hero-sub" data-rv>An intervention story, told from inside the ice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ACT 1 · FOUR BEATS ============ -->
  <section class="act act--beats" aria-label="What we are">
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="beats" id="beats">
        <div class="beat"><span class="n">01</span><h2 class="h-1">We are slow.</h2></div>
        <div class="beat"><span class="n">02</span><h2 class="h-1">Soft.</h2></div>
        <div class="beat"><span class="n">03</span><h2 class="h-1">Outnumbered by<br>things with claws.</h2></div>
        <div class="beat"><span class="n">04</span><h2 class="h-1">Still, we made fire.</h2></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ACT 2 · THE PARAGRAPH ============ -->
  <section class="act act--body" aria-label="What we invented">
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="wrap body-in">
        <p class="drop" data-rv>In the coldest stretch of the last glacial period, people with almost nothing invented the things we still use to recognise ourselves. None of it was decoration — shared story is how you coordinate a hunt and hand knowledge to people who will outlive you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ACT 3 · WHAT WE MADE ============ -->
  <section class="act act--made" aria-label="Music, art, stories, each other">
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="made-grid">
        <div class="made-head">
          <h2 class="h-1" data-rv="mask">Music. Art. Stories.<br>Each other.</h2>
        </div>
        <figure class="plate" data-rv>
          <canvas data-plate="flute" width="520" height="640" role="img"
            aria-label="Abstracted plate: a hollow bone flute, finger holes bored along its length."></canvas>
          <figcaption>A flute cut from bird bone. Someone worked out the finger holes.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="plate" data-rv>
          <canvas data-plate="hands" width="520" height="640" role="img"
            aria-label="Abstracted plate: ochre hand stencils on a cave wall."></canvas>
          <figcaption>Ochre handprints, stencilled by mouth. A signature before writing.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="plate" data-rv>
          <canvas data-plate="hearth" width="520" height="640" role="img"
            aria-label="Abstracted plate: a hearth, stones ringed around embers."></canvas>
          <figcaption>A hearth. Everything else is downstream of this.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ACT 4 · THRESHOLD ============ -->
  <section class="act act--threshold" aria-label="Threshold">
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="wrap threshold">
        <h2 class="h-2" data-rv>We have crossed a planetary threshold before.<br><em>We are doing it again, on purpose this time.</em></h2>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ACT 5 · WHITEOUT ============ -->
  <section class="act act--white" aria-label="Through the ice">
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="wrap white-in"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ PROOF ============ -->
  <section class="lit" id="proof" aria-labelledby="proofH">
    <div class="proof-pin" id="proofPin">
    <div class="proof-stage">
      <div class="proof-grid">
        <div class="proof-head">
          <p class="eyebrow on-light" data-pb="0">Proof — it has worked before</p>
          <h2 class="h-1" id="proofH" data-pb="0">We fixed the sky once.</h2>
        </div>

        <figure class="earth-hold">
          <div class="earth-wrap">
            <canvas id="earth" width="620" height="620" role="img"
              aria-label="The Antarctic ozone hole opening and closing between 1987 and 2066."></canvas>
            <p class="earth-year"><span id="earthYear">1987</span></p>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="earth-cap">
            <span class="ec-lab">Antarctic ozone hole</span>
            <span class="ec-note" id="earthNote">Montreal Protocol signed</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="proof-body">
          <p data-pb="1">In 1987 the world found a hole in the ozone layer and signed the Montreal Protocol. Nearly 99% of the controlled substances have been phased out. The layer is projected back to 1980 values around 2040 for most of the world, 2045 over the Arctic and 2066 over Antarctica. The Kigali Amendment later extended the same machinery to refrigerants.</p>
          <ul class="stats">
            <li data-pb="2"><b>~99%</b><span>Controlled ozone-depleting substances phased out</span></li>
            <li data-pb="2"><b>2040 · 2045 · 2066</b><span>Projected return to 1980 ozone values — world, Arctic, Antarctic</span></li>
            <li data-pb="2"><b>0.3–0.5 °C</b><span>Warming avoided by 2100 under the Kigali Amendment</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="pull" data-pb="3">A planetary problem, closed. It is the only one we have finished.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="proof-after">
      <div class="catch" data-rv>
        <h3>The catch</h3>
        <p>It took forty years, and it had to be policed: banned CFC-11 emissions were detected in 2018 and traced to eastern China three decades after signing. Ozone was also a narrower problem than energy — a handful of chemicals and a handful of manufacturers. Nobody had to redesign how the world is powered.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ INTERVENTIONS ============ -->
  <section class="lit" id="interventions" aria-label="Interventions">
    <div class="iv-intro">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="h-2" data-rv="mask">Five things people are actually doing.</h2>
        <p data-rv>None of these is a proposal. Each one is under way somewhere, with a location, a date and a set of people who can be named. Some of them will not work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="iv-deck" id="ivDeck">
    <!-- 01 -->
    <article class="iv" aria-labelledby="iv1">
      <div class="iv-step" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="iv-meta">
          <span class="iv-num">01</span>
          <dl>
            <dt>Where</dt><dd>Cambridge Bay, Nunavut</dd>
            <dt>When</dt><dd>Winters 2024–26</dd>
            <dt>Who</dt><dd>Real Ice · Arctic Reflections<br>ARIA / University of Cambridge</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-body">
          <h3 class="h-3" id="iv1">Making ice again</h3>
          <p data-rv>Two teams are out on the Arctic sea ice in winter, pumping seawater up from underneath so it freezes thicker. It is the technique that makes an ice road, aimed at a hemisphere.</p>
          <p data-rv>People are standing on the Arctic ice, rebuilding it by hand. One season, small patches — significantly less than a square kilometre. Whether it can scale is genuinely unknown, and several glaciologists think it can't. ARIA says so too: these experiments will not fix the Arctic. They are trying to find out whether the idea survives contact with the ice.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-lab">
          <div class="lab">
            <div class="lab-hd"><span class="k">Flood &amp; freeze</span><span class="v"><span id="iceRead">0</span> cm added</span></div>
            <div class="lab-bd"><canvas id="labIce" width="760" height="470" tabindex="0"
              role="application"
              aria-label="Sea ice thickening. Drag across the ice to pump seawater, or use the left and right arrow keys to move the pump and the up arrow or space bar to pump."></canvas></div>
            <div class="lab-ft"><span>Drag across the ice, or use the arrow keys</span><button class="lab-btn" data-reset="ice">Reset</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 02 -->
    <article class="iv" aria-labelledby="iv2">
      <div class="iv-step" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="iv-meta">
          <span class="iv-num">02</span>
          <dl>
            <dt>Where</dt><dd>Ahmedabad, Gujarat</dd>
            <dt>When</dt><dd>Since 2013</dd>
            <dt>Who</dt><dd>Ahmedabad Municipal Corporation<br>IIPH Gandhinagar · NRDC</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-body">
          <h3 class="h-3" id="iv2">Painting roofs white</h3>
          <p data-rv>In May 2010 a heatwave hit Ahmedabad and the city counted about a dozen deaths. A later study put the excess toll above 1,300. South Asia's first heat action plan followed in 2013 — early warnings, hospital readiness, water at bus stops, and reflective coatings on government buildings and thousands of informal-settlement roofs.</p>
          <p data-rv>The paint is the cheapest part and the part people can see. Reflective coatings measure 2–4 °C cooler indoors than conventional roofs; engineered modular roofs have recorded 7–8 °C. Researchers estimate the plan as a whole averts roughly 1,190 deaths a year. The template has since spread across more than twenty states.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-lab">
          <div class="lab light">
            <div class="lab-hd"><span class="k">Indoor temperature</span><span class="v"><span id="roofRead">41.0</span> °C</span></div>
            <div class="lab-bd">
              <div class="roofs" id="roofs" role="group" aria-label="Roof grid — activate a roof to coat it"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="lab-ft"><span>Drag across the roofs — <span id="roofPct">0</span>% coated</span><button class="lab-btn" data-reset="roof">Reset</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 03 -->
    <article class="iv" aria-labelledby="iv3">
      <div class="iv-step" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="iv-meta">
          <span class="iv-num">03</span>
          <dl>
            <dt>Where</dt><dd>Coastal, arid and urban sites</dd>
            <dt>When</dt><dd>Ongoing</dd>
            <dt>Who</dt><dd>Loess Plateau, China<br>Aravalli Biodiversity Park, Gurugram</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-body">
          <h3 class="h-3" id="iv3">Letting things come back</h3>
          <p data-rv>In a lot of damaged places, the fix is to stop doing something. Remove the fence, the concrete, the grazing pressure, the drainage — and the system often rebuilds itself faster than anyone expects.</p>
          <p data-rv>China banned free grazing across parts of the Loess Plateau, added terraces and check dams, and slowed a landscape that had been shedding soil into the Yellow River by the billion tonnes. In Gurugram, a 380-acre quartzite mining pit was replanted with native Aravalli species from 2012; it now holds more than 300 plant species and 195 bird species, and in 2022 became India's first OECM conservation site.</p>
          <p data-rv><strong>Sometimes the design is a decision to stop.</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-lab">
          <div class="lab light">
            <div class="lab-hd"><span class="k">Recovery</span><span class="v"><span id="regenRead">0</span>%</span></div>
            <div class="lab-bd"><canvas id="labRegen" width="760" height="380"
              aria-label="Interactive: a degraded slope that regreens as pressures are removed."></canvas></div>
            <div class="toggles" id="regenToggles"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 04 -->
    <article class="iv" aria-labelledby="iv4">
      <div class="iv-step" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="iv-meta">
          <span class="iv-num">04</span>
          <dl>
            <dt>Where</dt><dd>Montreal → Kigali</dd>
            <dt>When</dt><dd>1987 – present</dd>
            <dt>Who</dt><dd>198 parties</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-body">
          <h3 class="h-3" id="iv4">Signing agreements</h3>
          <p data-rv>Montreal worked because it was more than a promise: a binding phase-out schedule, a fund for developing countries, trade measures against non-parties, monitoring, and a mechanism to make itself stricter over time.</p>
          <p data-rv>Every part of that list is unglamorous. Together they are the only reason we can point at a planetary problem and say it is finished. Switch any one of them off and see what remains.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-lab">
          <div class="lab">
            <div class="lab-hd"><span class="k">Treaty integrity</span><span class="v"><span id="mechRead">100</span>%</span></div>
            <div class="mech" id="mech"></div>
            <div class="outcome">
              <div class="meter"><i id="mechMeter"></i></div>
              <p id="mechNote">All five mechanisms in place. This is the configuration that closed the ozone hole.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 05 -->
    <article class="iv" aria-labelledby="iv5">
      <div class="iv-step" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="iv-meta">
          <span class="iv-num">05</span>
          <dl>
            <dt>Where</dt><dd>Delhi · Gujarat · Rajasthan</dd>
            <dt>When</dt><dd>Antiquity → now</dd>
            <dt>Who</dt><dd>Ant Studio · Ozone Cell, MoEFCC</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-body">
          <h3 class="h-3" id="iv5">Old cooling, reused</h3>
          <p data-rv>A lot of climate design is retrieval, not invention. The stepwell, the jaali screen, the courtyard, the wet terracotta pot — all of them are cooling systems, and all of them predate the compressor.</p>
          <p data-rv>In Delhi, the architect Monish Siripurapu built a cooler out of stacked terracotta cones, water trickling over them, air pulled through: an earthen pot turned inside out, no refrigerant, a fraction of the power. India published the world's first national cooling plan in 2019, aiming to cut cooling demand 20–25% and refrigerant demand 25–30% by 2037–38.</p>
          <p data-rv><strong>The oldest answer in the room is often still in the room.</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="iv-lab">
          <div class="lab">
            <div class="lab-hd"><span class="k">Cooling method</span><span class="v" id="coolRead">Compressor</span></div>
            <div class="lab-bd"><canvas id="labCool" width="760" height="420"
              aria-label="Interactive: cross-fade between a compressor unit and a terracotta evaporative wall."></canvas></div>
            <div class="xfade">
              <label for="coolSlide" class="lab-ft" style="padding:0;border:0;opacity:.6;">Slide from compressor to terracotta</label>
              <input type="range" id="coolSlide" min="0" max="100" value="0" aria-label="Cooling method: compressor to terracotta">
              <div class="xf-labels"><span>Compressor</span><span>Terracotta</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ INDIA ============ -->
  <section class="lit" id="india" aria-labelledby="indiaH">
    <div class="map-head">
      <div class="num"><span class="iv-num">06</span></div>
      <h2 class="h-2" id="indiaH" data-rv="mask">Eight projects in India</h2>
      <p data-rv>India usually appears in climate coverage as a place things happen to. These are eight programmes built here — several of them exported since.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="map-shell">
      <div class="map-hold">
        <svg id="indiaMap" viewBox="-18 -30 1046.0 1199.7" role="group"
             aria-label="Map of India showing the location of eight climate programmes"></svg>
        <p class="map-src">Boundaries: Natural Earth 1:10m, India point-of-view edition.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="map-side">
        <ol class="map-list" id="mapList" aria-label="The eight programmes"></ol>
        <div class="map-panel" aria-live="polite">
          <p class="mp-idx" id="mpIdx">01 / 08</p>
          <h3 class="mp-name" id="mpName">—</h3>
          <div class="mp-meta"><span class="chip" id="mpTag">—</span><span class="mp-loc" id="mpLoc">—</span></div>
          <p class="mp-body" id="mpBody">—</p>
          <div class="mp-nav">
            <button id="mpPrev" aria-label="Previous programme">←</button>
            <button id="mpNext" aria-label="Next programme">→</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ DESIGN A PLANET ============ -->
  <section id="planet" aria-labelledby="dpH">
    <div class="dp">
      <div class="dp-head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-rv>Design a planet</p>
        <h2 class="h-2" id="dpH" data-rv="mask">Four decisions. They carry.</h2>
        <p data-rv>Nothing here is hypothetical — every option is something a government or a village has already done. Choose, and the last part of this site is built out of what you chose.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="qs" id="qs"></div>
      <div class="dp-out">
        <p class="h-3" id="dpOut">Make four choices and the closing environment will be built from them.</p>
        <p>Your planet is rendered live in the closing scene below. Choices are kept in this browser tab only.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CLOSING ============ -->
  <section id="closing" aria-labelledby="closeH">
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="wrap close-in">
        <h2 class="h-1" id="closeH" data-rv="mask">The ice never left.<br>Neither did we.</h2>
        <p data-rv>By the geological definition we are still in an ice age — there is permanent ice at both poles, and the Holocene is an intermission. Everything we point at as evidence of being human was invented during the cold, by people under climate stress.</p>
        <p class="final" data-rv>The ice didn't interrupt us. It invented us.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<!-- VIDEO -->
<div class="iceworld-video" style="width: 100%; background: #000; padding: 40px 20px; display: flex; justify-content: center;">
  <video style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;" autoplay muted loop playsinline>
    <source src="./iceworldloop.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
</div>

</main>

